Hi Managers,

Thanks to Ronald Dufresne and George Gallen for their assistance.

The problem was narrowed down to 3 users that was moved to another site.
It takes the server more than 2 minutes for the packets to reach these
users.  In the meantime, the 3 users continuously send login request to
Linkworks, which runs out of available 'servers' to handle the request.
Eventually, there are no more available 'servers' and any user needing
'servers' would time out.  We have disconnected these 3 users and
everything went back to normal.

We are looking at finding a faster route for these users and have increased
the number of available 'servers' from Linkworks.

Thanks,

